sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to change the availability of the Charging Station to Inoperative

    CSMS->>CS: ChangeAvailabilityRequest (operationalStatus = Inoperative)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: operationalStatus Inoperative<br>evseId omitted<br>connectorId omitted

    CS-->>CSMS: ChangeAvailabilityResponse (status = Accepted)

    loop For all connectors
        CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Unavailable)
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Unavailable", component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
        CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
    end
